<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"invite_id":null,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":17,"quiz_completions":2,"text_analyses":57,"last_activity_date":"2026-06-17T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T13:01:29.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"lifetime_access":false,"ai_access":true,"ai_credits_used":0,"ai_credits_reset_at":"2026-07-01T00:00:00.000000Z","ai_credit_limit":null,"plan_override":"premium","subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"plan":"premium","hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":true,"hasAiAccess":true,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"billingEnabled":false,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"error":null,"info":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":10,"name":"Prev"},"cards":[{"id":51452,"front":"<p>After a stressful week, a short weekend _______ to the countryside was exactly what I needed. <em>(r\u00f6vid utaz\u00e1s \/ kikapcsol\u00f3d\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The couple planned a romantic _______ to a secluded island for their anniversary. <em>(romantikus kiruccan\u00e1s \/ elvonul\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The bank robbers&#039; _______ car was found abandoned a few miles from the scene. <em>(menek\u00fcl\u0151 \/ sz\u00f6k\u00e9shez haszn\u00e1lt)<\/em><\/p><p>For many, retirement marks the beginning of a long-awaited _______ from the daily grind. <em>(szabadul\u00e1s \/ menek\u00fcl\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kiruccan\u00e1s \/ menek\u00fcl\u00e9s \/ sz\u00f6k\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; bor