e<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>displacement<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>displace<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: displace workers \/ displace populations \/ displace water \/ displace a competitor<\/span><\/p><p>similar: relocate \/ oust \/ remove \/ supplant<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ maintain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-16","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17","due_at":"2026-06-17T22:20:46+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-16T20:59:21+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-16","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T20:10:08+00:00"},{"id":51458,"front":"<p>After weeks of illness, the cat looked very _______ and weak. <em>(sov\u00e1ny \/ v\u00e9zna)<\/em><\/p><p>The air was so _______ that it was difficult to breathe at high altitudes. <em>(ritka \/ h\u00edg)<\/em><\/p><p>She wore a _______ silk scarf to protect her neck from the sun. <em>(v\u00e9kony \/ \u00e1ttetsz\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The plot of the movie was rather _______, lacking depth and originality. <em>(fel\u00fcletes \/ gyenge)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">v\u00e9kony \/ sov\u00e1ny \/ ritka<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): vastag \/ k\u00f6v\u00e9r \/ s\u0171r\u0171<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 get _______ = lefogyni (pl. I need to get _______ before summer.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ air = ritka leveg\u0151 (pl. Mountain climbers often struggle with the _______ air.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ ice = v\u00e9kony j\u00e9g (pl. We&#039;re on _______ ice with this project.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ line = v\u00e9kony vonal (pl. There&#039;s a _______ line between confidence and arrogance.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>thin<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>thin<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>thinly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>thinness<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>thin<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: thin air \/ thin ice \/ thin layer \/ thin line<\/span><\/p><p>similar: slender \/ skinny \/ lean \/ sparse<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: thick \/ fat \/ dense<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-14","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-16T08:37:28+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-15T07:49:03+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-14","reviewed_on":"2026-06-15"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"45 perc","good":"1 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T14:07:40+00:00"},{"id":51460,"front":"<p>The student&#039;s repeated acts of _______ towards the teacher led to a serious disciplinary meeting. <em>(pimaszs\u00e1g \/ arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>He was fired for his _______ and disrespect towards senior management during the crucial meeting. <em>(tiszteletlens\u00e9g \/ szemtelen viselked\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite her humble background, she never tolerated any _______ from those who thought themselves superior. <em>(g\u0151g\u00f6s viselked\u00e9s \/ lekezel\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>The king, known for his strict demeanor, would not countenance such _______ from his courtiers. <em>(udvariatlans\u00e1g \/ szemtelens\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g \/ pimaszs\u00e1g \/ szemtelen viselked\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): tisztelet \/ al\u00e1zat \/ udvariass\u00e1g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 act of _______ = arc\u00e1tlan tett (pl. His act of _______ was unforgivable.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 display _______ = arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1got mutat (pl. She displayed great _______ by interrupting the speaker.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 accused of _______ = arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1ggal v\u00e1dolva (pl. He was accused of _______ after his outburst.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unforgivable _______ = megbocs\u00e1thatatlan arc\u00e1tlans\u00e1g (pl. Such unforgivable _______ cannot be tolerated.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>insolence<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>insolent<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>insolently<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>insolence<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: blatant insolence \/ sheer insolence \/ utter insolence \/ act of insolence<\/span><\/p><p>similar: impertinence \/ impudence \/ disrespect \/ audacity<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: deference \/ respect \/ humility<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"insolence\ninsolent\ninsolently","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-15","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-16T21:58:24+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-16T11:23:12+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-15","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"3 \u00f3ra","good":"6 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T20:09:42+00:00"},{"id":51453,"front":"<p>_______ her sister, Sarah is very quiet and prefers to read rather than socialize. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy, _______ previous attempts, focuses on long-term sustainable solutions. <em>(m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp mint \/ nem \u00fagy mint)<\/em><\/p><p>_______ many other species, bats are nocturnal and hunt primarily at night. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \/ k\u00fcl\u00f6nben)<\/em><\/p><p>His latest novel is _______ anything he has written before, exploring a much darker theme. <em>(nem hasonl\u00f3an \/ nem \u00fagy mint)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben \/ m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp mint<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): hasonl\u00f3an \/ ugyan\u00fagy \/ megegyez\u0151en<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ anyone else = mindenki m\u00e1ssal ellent\u00e9tben (pl. _______ anyone else, he always arrives early.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ what you might think = ellent\u00e9tben azzal, amit gondoln\u00e1l (pl. _______ what you might think, the job is quite challenging.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ most people = a legt\u00f6bb emberrel ellent\u00e9tben (pl. _______ most people, she enjoys working on weekends.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ his usual self = nem a megszokott \u00f6nmaga (pl. He was quiet and withdrawn, _______ his usual self.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>unlike<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: unlike most \/ unlike many \/ unlike anything \/ unlike his<\/span><\/p><p>similar: different from \/ dissimilar to \/ in contrast to \/ not like<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: like \/ similar to \/ alike<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#636