 m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp \u00e9rtelmezni)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e1tkeretez \/ \u00fajra\u00e9rtelmez \/ \u00e1tfogalmaz<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): fenntart \/ megtart \/ r\u00f6gz\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a problem = egy probl\u00e9m\u00e1t \u00e1tkeretezni (pl. We need to reframe the problem to find a better solution.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ your perspective = a n\u00e9z\u0151pontodat \u00e1tkeretezni (pl. Learning to reframe your perspective can reduce stress.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a situation = egy helyzetet \u00fajra\u00e9rtelmezni (pl. She helped me reframe the situation in a more positive light.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ an issue = egy k\u00e9rd\u00e9st \u00e1tfogalmazni (pl. The politician tried to reframe the issue to gain public support.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>reframe<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>reframe<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>reframe<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: reframe the narrative \/ reframe your thinking \/ reframe a challenge \/ reframe the debate<\/span><\/p><p>similar: reinterpret \/ reconceptualize \/ rethink \/ rephrase<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: maintain \/ preserve \/ sustain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"reframe","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-16","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17","due_at":"2026-06-17T21:20:43+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-16T20:29:54+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":2,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-16","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"1.5 \u00f3ra","good":"2 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T20:28:14+00:00"},{"id":51463,"front":"<p>The new factory will _______ hundreds of local workers, forcing them to seek jobs elsewhere. <em>(munkahely\u00e9r\u0151l elmozd\u00edt \/ \u00e1ll\u00e1s\u00e1b\u00f3l kiszor\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Rising sea levels threaten to _______ millions of people from their homes in coastal regions. <em>(lak\u00f3hely\u00e9r\u0151l el\u0171z \/ otthon\u00e1b\u00f3l kiszor\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>In physics, a submerged object will _______ a volume of fluid equal to its own volume. <em>(v\u00edzbe mer\u00fclve kiszor\u00edt \/ hely\u00e9b\u0151l kimozd\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The invention of the automobile began to _______ horses as the primary mode of transportation. <em>(felv\u00e1lt \/ helyettes\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elmozd\u00edt \/ kisaj\u00e1t\u00edt \/ felv\u00e1lt<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): hely\u00e9n tart \/ megtart \/ meg\u0151riz<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ people = embereket elmozd\u00edt\/kisaj\u00e1t\u00edt (pl. The conflict continues to _______ people from their homes.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a population = n\u00e9pess\u00e9get kiszor\u00edt (pl. Climate change could _______ a significant portion of the population.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ water = vizet kiszor\u00edt (pl. A ship will _______ a large amount of water as it floats.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a rival = riv\u00e1list kiszor\u00edt (pl. New technology can quickly _______ a rival from the market.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>displace<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>displacement<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>displace<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: displace workers \/ displace populations \/ displace water \/ displace a competitor<\/span><\/p><p>similar: relocate \/ oust \/ remove \/ supplant<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ maintain<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-16","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-16T20:10:08+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-16T19:59:31+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-16","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-17T22:20:46+00:00"},{"id":51453,"front":"<p>_______ her sister, Sarah is very quiet and prefers to read rather than socialize. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben)<\/em><\/p><p>The new policy, _______ previous attempts, focuses on long-term sustainable solutions. <em>(m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp mint \/ nem \u00fagy mint)<\/em><\/p><p>_______ many other species, bats are nocturnal and hunt primarily at night. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \/ k\u00fcl\u00f6nben)<\/em><\/p><p>His latest novel is _______ anything he has written before, exploring a much darker theme. <em>(nem hasonl\u00f3an \/ nem \u00fagy mint)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ellent\u00e9tben \/ szemben \/ m\u00e1sk\u00e9pp mint<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): hasonl\u00f3an \/ ugyan\u00fagy \/ megegyez\u0151en<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ anyone else = mindenki m\u00e1ssal ellent\u00e9tben (pl. _______ anyone else, he always arrives early.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ what you might think = ellent\u00e9tben azzal, amit gondoln\u00e1l (pl. _______ what you might think, the job is quite challenging.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ most people = a legt\u00f6bb emberrel ellent\u00e9tben (pl. _______ most people, she enjoys working on weekends.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ his usual self = nem a megszokott \u00f6nmaga (pl. He was quiet and withdrawn, _______ his usual self.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>unlike<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: unlike most \/ unlike many \/ unlike anything \/ unlike his<\/span><\/p><p>similar: different from \/ dissimilar to \/ in contrast to \/ not like<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: like \/ similar to \/ alike<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-13","reviewed_on":"2026-06-17","due_at":"2026-06-17T20:21:37+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-16T09:06:51+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":3,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-13","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T08:21:43+00:00"},{"id":51450,"front":"<p>Many people _______ the new tax proposal, arguing it would disproportionately affect low-income families. <em>(ellenez \/ szembesz\u00e1ll)<\/em><\/p><p>The two political parties often _______ each other on fundamental issues, making compromise difficult. <em>(ellent\u00e9tben \u00e1ll \/ szemben \u00e1ll)<\/em><\/p><p>She decided to _______ her father&#039;s wishes and pursue a career in art, despite his disapproval. <em>(szembeszeg\u00fcl \/ ellen\u00e1ll)<\/em><\/p><p>The protesters gathered to _______ the construction of the new factory, citing environmental concerns. <em>(tiltakozik \/ ellen\u00e1ll)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ellenez \/ szembesz\u00e1ll \/ ellen\u00e1ll<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): t\u00e1mogat \/ egyet\u00e9rt \/ helyesel<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a proposal = javaslatot ellenez (pl. They decided to _______ a proposal that they found unfair.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a decision = d\u00f6nt\u00e9st ellenez (pl. The board voted to _______ the decision made by the CEO.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ change = v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1snak ellen\u00e1ll (pl. Some people naturally _______ change and prefer the status quo.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ strongly = er\u0151sen ellenez (pl. The community will _______ strongly any plans to build on the nature reserve.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>oppose<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>opposed<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>opposition<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>oppose<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: oppose a plan \/ oppose a law \/ oppose an idea \/ oppose strongly<\/span><\/p><p>similar: resist \/ object \/ disagree \/ defy<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: support \/ agree \/ endorse<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"oppose\nopposition","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":5,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-13","reviewed_on":"2026-06-16","due_at":"2026-06-16T14:06:57+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"learning","due_at":"2026-06-15T18:18:10+00:00","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":4,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-06-13","reviewed_on":"2026-06-15"}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"9 \u00f3ra","good":"1 nap","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-06-16T14:07:37+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/10\/study","version":"5e10d6771de66742ea82be93